  "verification": [
    "Read AGENTS, master sections21-24 and P06 gate, current status/next steps, storage contracts, ADR0010/0011 and P06 device-resource amendment to ADR0004. Compared transport reset/configuration ordering against primary OASIS VirtIO1.2 CS01.",
    "Reviewed bounded PCI capability enumeration, memory BAR sizing/restoration and conflicts, exact modern device matching, CPUID physical-width device mapping, uncached MMIO and retained RAM/DMA token ownership.",
    "Reviewed feature negotiation, volatile descriptor/ring ordering, four-slot split queue, checked completion heads/status/lengths, stopped submission path, hardware reset acknowledgement and bus-master disable before DMA reclamation.",
    "Reviewed block bounds and exact-transfer errors, mirrored GPT headers/arrays and identity/overlap checks, FAT32 chains/mirrors and read-only policy, immutable initfs and explicit mount incarnation boundaries.",
    "Reviewed ext2 feature whitelist and complete bounded allocation graph, one coherent cache page, dirty/clean flush ordering, failed mutation poisoning, zero-filled file extension, preflighted capacity, stable inode identity across rename and validated remount.",
    "Reviewed storage diagnostics with actual DMA-backed reads/writes/flushes, dedicated scratch-sector reset, real-prefix short-I/O injection, independent clean remount and eight-page frame reclamation; callbacks sample the original guarded128KiB boot stack.",
    "Final report passed the exact current persistent phase validator:190 host tests, strict host/firmware/kernel/native lint/checks, portable-target checks and two independently matching five-artifact guest builds with unchanged inputs.",
    "Independently recomputed181 source snapshot hashes including145 phase build/assembly/linker/contract/hardware inputs,19 report identities,127 command records,254 raw stdout/stderr hashes,17 scenario serial hashes and three screenshot hashes.",
    "All15 earlier actual guest scenarios remain required and passed, including deliberate failures, memory protections, minimum-memory and1/2/4CPU/degraded protected native execution. Two additional actual storage boots independently write then reopen the same private128MiB raw image.",
    "Storage write performed176 exact block-layer reads,18 writes and5 flushes; reopen performed146 reads,1 injected-prefix write and3 flushes. Observed stack margins were70400 and80336 bytes respectively. Both observed hardware reset/quiescence and exact eight-page DMA reclamation.",
    "Guest6000-byte content plus1024-byte cross-block patch, rename while open, flush and reboot recovery yield CRC32aaa29e86. Persistent gate independently re-audited initial,write,reopen and final raw images, exact payload bytes, graph/counts, immutable GPT/FAT and the single permitted reset scratch sector.",
    "Independent current-source filesystem oracle passed10000 randomized create/read/write/gap/rename/EOF operations with40 live file identities and100 complete exact-content remounts.",
    "Independent failure probe passed270 create/growth/rename write-position and partial-sector-prefix cases, requiring poisoned live access after errors and validating any accepted clean remount.10000 independent malformed metadata bit mutations produced no panic; accepted changes were not assumed to be all corruptions.",
    "Independent queue probe passed2956800 calculated completion/status/length and wrapping used-index cases,100000 full/cancel/out-of-order/reset/restart/stale-token lifecycles and artificial nonwrapping generation exhaustion boundaries.",
    "Eleven consistently rebound gate mutations rejected weaker phase, missing/optional host checks, missing queue/profile bindings, missing write/reopen boots, weakened markers, duplicated/swapped storage case and missing/wrong fixture evidence.",
    "Twenty-two mutations of actual final storage serial evidence rejected missing short-I/O/reset/stale/poison/remount/features/persistence/DMA/stack guarantees. Eight in-memory mutations of actual final raw disk bytes rejected GPT,FAT,allocation,inode,directory and payload corruption.",
    "Viewed actual normal,diagnostic and panic screenshots and checked completed H/D/R/P/reboot evidence. The demo intentionally remains the earlier protected-native console; storage evidence comes from the two separately qualified disk boots.",
    "No product source or documentation was changed by this review; no actionable defect remained within the explicitly bounded P06 profile. Closure status/report binding and P07 activation remain the phase owner responsibility."
